      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i'm trying to report a streetlamp that's acting up on corner of melbourne st and oak ave. it always starts flickering like crazy around 4pm every day. can u tell me how i can get this fixed and if there is a way to track the repair?",
      "source": "evaluator"
